{{#hasOversized}}
## Oversized tool results

The largest individual tool results in the window. Each row is one call — payloads this size dominate context cost and often indicate an unscoped read or shell dump.

| Tool | Scope | Bytes |
|---|---|---:|
{{#oversized}}
| `{{tool}}` | `{{scope}}` | {{bytes}} |
{{/oversized}}

Suggestions: pipe long command output through a summarizer, skip lockfiles, paginate `Read`, or replace dump-style commands with targeted queries. Results from `WebSearch`, `WebFetch`, and `Agent` are externally determined — ignore those rows.

